s to everyone who signed up so far. We still need a couple of hands for setup and cleanup. Reply to the thread if you can pitch in this year.", "category": "forums", "read": true}, {"folder": "inbox", "from_name": "Trailhead Runners Club", "from_email": "digest@trailrunners.example.com", "to_name": "Alice Anderson", "to_email": "alice@shopgym.com", "subject": "This week's group runs", "body": "Tuesday easy 5k from the park, Thursday hill repeats, and a long run Sunday morning. All paces welcome. See the thread for meeting spots and times.", "category": "forums", "read": false}, {"folder": "inbox", "from_name": "Lumen Public Library", "from_email": "noreply@lumenlibrary.example.com", "to_name": "Alice Anderson", "to_email": "alice@shopgym.com", "subject": "Your holds are ready for pickup", "body": "Two items are waiting for you at the Front Street branch. Please pick them up by Friday to keep your place in line. Hours are 9am to 8pm on weekdays.", "category": "updates", "read": false}, {"folder": "inbox", "from_name": "Nimbus Cloud Storage", "from_email": "account@nimbusdrive.example.com", "to_name": "Alice Anderson", "to_email": "alice@shopgym.com", "subject": "You're running low on storage", "body": "You've used 92% of your 15 GB. Clearing out old files or upgrading your plan will keep your uploads syncing smoothly. You can manage storage anytime from settings.", "category": "updates", "read": true}, {"folder": "inbox", "from_name": "Meridian Transit", "from_email": "noreply@meridiantransit.example.com", "to_name": "Alice Anderson", "to_email": "alice@shopgym.com", "subject": "Your July ride receipt", "body": "Thanks for riding with us this month. Here's a summary of your 14 trips, including your monthly pass discount. No action needed \u2014 this is just for your records.", "category": "updates", "read": true}, {"folder": "inbox", "from_name": "StreamFlix", "from_email": "billing@streamflix.example.com", "to_name": "Alice Anderson", "to_email": "alice@shopgym.com"